            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Inner-face effect wires approach the same top dot from below."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "frames, world, queue, and robot mutations each survive two boundaries."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Ordinary RGB-D, tracking, grasp, trajectory, torque, and report data remain wired."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Collapsing and reopening execute_pick() preserves every connection."
                }
